001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          CNDESC.
001300 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        NOVEMBER 1986.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM RETURNS UP TO 25 LINES OF DESCRIPTION
001900*           FOR ANY NONCODED ITEM PASSED TO IT.
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DPODATAITM
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1101
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
            RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
            FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002500 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DPODATAITM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPODATAITM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1100 OF MCFLCS1101.

002600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002700 01  SUB                     PIC 9(2)  VALUE 1.
002800
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1       PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2       PIC X VALUE SPACE.
002900 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYCSIS.
003000**************************************************************
003100**            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
003200**************************************************************
003300
003400 COPY DBSTAT OF COPYCSIS.
003500 COPY DBMODES OF COPYCSIS.
003600 COPY DATAB3 OF COPYCSIS.
003700
003900 COPY DPODATA OF COPYCSIS.
004000**************************************************************
004100**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
004200**************************************************************
004300 LINKAGE SECTION.
004400 01  BASE                       PIC X(10).
004500 01  PASSED-PO                  PIC X(14).
004600 01  CNDESC-ITEM                PIC X(4).
004700 COPY CNDESC2 OF COPYCSIS.
004800
004900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE, PASSED-PO,
005000                          CNDESC-ITEM, CNDESC-DATA.
005100
005200 00-CNDESC-MAIN.
           MOVE 1 TO SUB.
           OPEN INPUT DPODATAITM.
005300     PERFORM 600-MAIN THRU 699-EXIT.
005400     COMPUTE CNDESC-LINES-GOT = SUB.
           CLOSE DPODATAITM.
005500     GOBACK.
005600
005700 600-MAIN.
005800     MOVE SPACES                   TO   CNDESC-LINE.
005900     MOVE PASSED-PO                TO   PO-ARG.
006000
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD CNDESC-LINES-GOT.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO   OF DPODATAITM-REC.
           MOVE SPACES TO ITEMSEQNO OF DPODATAITM-REC.
           IF CNDESC-ITEM NOT = SPACES
                MOVE CNDESC-ITEM TO ITEMSEQNO OF DPODATAITM-REC.
           START DPODATAITM KEY NOT < EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
006300     IF NOT GOOD-CALL
006400           MOVE "DBFIND DPODATAITM AT 600-MAIN IN CNDESC"
006500                                        TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
006600           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
006610     IF NO-ENTRY
006620        COMPUTE SUB = 0
006630        GO TO 699-EXIT.
006640
006700
006800 620-GET-DESCRIPTION.
006900*----------  GET DESCRIPTION
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPODATAITM NEXT INTO BUF-DPODATAITM
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DPODATAITM-REC NOT = PO-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
007200     IF END-OF-CHAIN
007300         GO TO 699-EXIT
007400     ELSE
007500         IF NOT GOOD-CALL
007600           MOVE "DBGET DSET-DPODATAITM AT 620 IN CNDESC "
007700                         TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
007800           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
007900
008000     IF DATAITM-ITEM-NO NOT = CNDESC-ITEM
008100        GO TO 620-GET-DESCRIPTION.
008200
           IF SUB > 25
               GO TO 699-EXIT.

008300     MOVE DATAITM-INFO   TO   CNDESC (SUB).
008400
008500     IF SUB = CNDESC-LINES-TO-GET
008510        NEXT SENTENCE
008520     ELSE
008600        ADD 1 TO SUB
008700        GO TO 620-GET-DESCRIPTION.
008800
008900 699-EXIT.  EXIT.
009000
009100 990-BLOWUP.
009200     MOVE PO-ARG                TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
009300     MOVE DATAITM-LINE          TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
009400     MOVE "CNDESC"              TO BU-PGM-NAME.
009500     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
009600           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
009700           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
009800 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
